{% comment %}
  The Premium ordering block, with the consult requirement attached.

  Two modes, switched by `enforce_consult` below:

    Soft gate (current)  — the requirement is stated plainly and the products
                           stay purchasable. Nobody with a profile already on
                           file gets locked out, and nobody has to be logged in
                           to order. The lab catches the rare stranger at order
                           review, which is cheaper than losing a real sale to a
                           gate that fired wrongly.

    Hard gate            — buy options render only for a logged-in customer
                           carrying the premium tag. Everyone else is sent to
                           the consult. Turn this on once premium clients are
                           actually being tagged in the Shopify admin; until
                           they are, this would lock out every existing client.

  Switching modes is the one `assign` on the next line. No markup below needs
  to change.

  The grid itself is cfl-format-grid, the same tag-driven component the standard
  film-processing page uses, pointed at the premium collection. Premium products
  carry the same format and process tags as the rest of the processing catalog,
  so formats appear and disappear here purely by what is live in the admin.

  Accepts:
    - show_heading {Boolean} Render the section heading.

  Usage:
    {% render 'cfl-premium-order', show_heading: true %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign enforce_consult = false
  assign premium_tag = 'premium-client'

  assign consult = all_products['premium-client-color-profile']
  assign premium_collection = collections['premium-film-service']

  assign unlocked = true
  if enforce_consult
    assign unlocked = false
    if customer and customer.tags contains premium_tag
      assign unlocked = true
    endif
  endif
-%}

<div class="cfl-premium-order" id="cfl-premium-order">
  {%- if show_heading -%}
    <h2 class="cfl-section-heading">Order Premium</h2>
  {%- endif -%}

  {%- if unlocked -%}
    <div class="cfl-premium-gate cfl-premium-gate--notice">
      <p class="cfl-premium-gate__lead">
        <strong>Premium orders need a color profile on file.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        If you have not sat down with us yet, start with the consult: without a profile there
        is nothing for us to match your scans to.
        {%- if consult != blank %}
          <a href="{{ consult.url }}">Book your color profile consult</a>.
        {%- endif -%}
      </p>
      <p class="cfl-premium-gate__quiet">
        Not sure whether yours is on file? <a href="{{ pages['contact-us'].url }}">Ask us</a> before
        you order.
      </p>
    </div>

    {%- if premium_collection != blank and premium_collection.products.size > 0 -%}
      {% render 'cfl-format-grid',
         grid_collection: premium_collection,
         heading: 'Pick your film type',
         intro: 'Premium covers 35mm and medium format. Prices are per roll.',
         heading_tag: 'h3' %}
    {%- endif -%}

  {%- else -%}
    <div class="cfl-premium-gate cfl-premium-gate--locked">
      <p class="cfl-premium-gate__lead">
        <strong>Premium is by consultation.</strong>
      </p>
      <p>
        Every Premium order is edited against a color profile we build with you in person or over
        video. Book that session and ordering opens up straight afterward.
      </p>

      {%- if consult != blank -%}
        <a class="button button--primary" href="{{ consult.url }}">
          Book your color profile consult — {{ consult.price | money }}
        </a>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- unless customer -%}
        <p class="cfl-premium-gate__quiet">
          Already a Premium client? <a href="{{ routes.account_login_url }}">Log in</a> to order.
        </p>
      {%- else -%}
        <p class="cfl-premium-gate__quiet">
          Already had your consult but still seeing this?
          <a href="{{ pages['contact-us'].url }}">Let us know</a> and we'll open your account up.
        </p>
      {%- endunless -%}
    </div>
  {%- endif -%}
</div>
